# QA M3 acceptance (D-061 addendum E19, a Pilger file wakes together) in
# the real level: the qa_falkenstein_relaxed inputs to the Fürberg pilgrim's
# stomp (300), then Resi walks to x 422 and stops. The camera parks at
# x 284, so the activation edge (camera x + 640 = 924) lies inside group A
# (lead 57, 58, 59 at x 913, 929, 945): probe-checked, all three wake on
# frame 379 and stay 16 px apart all the way down the Kreuzweg steps. The
# file reaches her at 1337 (Hurt, Zuckerschock -> Normal), passes in her
# i-frames, turns at the garden wall and kills her at 1862. A split file
# (the bug E19 fixed) would change both frames.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = event=Hurt dies_at frames=1862..1862 deaths=1 lives=2 power=normal
---
# --- the first 300 frames of qa_falkenstein_relaxed.replay ---
R 120
J 12
- 125
R 4
RJ 18
R 21
# --- end of the prefix ---
R 72      # stop at x 422: the camera parks at x 284, activation edge 924 cuts through group A (913/929/945)
- 1500    # the whole file wakes at 379 and walks down to her in file
